{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ae41b2ce5b067a6c7eccc5f129c4acc46a88f0f3c4945a21b6fc2bb680d9d0c8","ja":"お菓子に気持ちを添えて","zh":"为点心寄托心意","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a851c2b44eb3d32934c6d0951b0618144f8e81605743e04ab51c7c372cc66d47","ja":"莉緒さん、この間はありがとうございました！\n私も真壁さんも、クッキーを選んでみました。","zh":"莉绪姐，前些天真是太感谢了！\n我和真壁都试着挑选了曲奇。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6df848ec5739bb943d83a98a42c5539d7251bc3a9c9c21a926c07b6d13c045e9","ja":"クッキーの意味は、「あなたは友達」。\n学校のみなさんにお渡しするなら、ぴったりかと。","zh":"曲奇的含义是“你是我的朋友”。\n要是送给学校的各位，应该再合适不过了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a80a3b1059b84e0895472de67cf17ceada9f96341f0c569a8eab4c501a6ea18a","ja":"いいお買い物ができたみたいね。","zh":"看来买到了很棒的东西呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"020107e03b01a026211fbdd3695888f0b5ce0e62b8fac08dcd36950c9e44d729","ja":"はい。教えてもらったお菓子のお店、\n試食もできて、すごく選びやすかったです。","zh":"是的。您推荐的那家点心店\n不仅能试吃，还特别好挑选呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"19b7c967ad1b2657fc2d4cb30afb9a656fbc68c6e612dccd19f1ba4386f7ceec","ja":"ラッピングも、かわいい上に品がありました。\nおかげで、自信をもってお返しできます。","zh":"包装不仅可爱，而且很高雅。\n托您的福，我可以满怀信心地去回礼了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c1de58bb93d138aeac098ce17ecda1a2e772e5323e7753860b29c2f9c2b3c746","ja":"気に入ってもらえてよかったわ♪","zh":"你能喜欢真是太好了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d0406e5460ae1a45b262b986b7394b979680051b207603a2aaa8624fdb27061d","ja":"本当に、ありがとうございました。\nそれで……お礼に、私たちからこちらのお菓子を。","zh":"真的非常感谢您。\n所以……作为谢礼，这是我们送给您的点心。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"30924abf0546b6c71cb780e2db0a4051c579ecd57acc6edde67962ea55a3d558","ja":"あら、ありがとう。\nなにかしら……。","zh":"哎呀，谢谢你。\n会是什么呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"02394f1b45b13abf886491406e834c983863ca8bce977695fff803f48fbbbbe0","ja":"あっ、キャラメルね♪\nええと、これはどんな意味だったかしら？","zh":"啊，是焦糖呢♪\n呃，这个代表着什么含义来着？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2e90b275ace0a5acf3bf7179b6fa1fb02cbc40f0439430f6f5bd13b452347279","ja":"キャラメルの意味は、\n「あなたと一緒にいると安心……」。","zh":"焦糖的含义是，\n“和你在一起就很安心……”。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"37112c922adc58ad421b9f582a86e8a80a0c7f86bf2d5acb5bbd74d7a0629931","ja":"しーっ！　真壁さん！　ストップです！！","zh":"嘘——！真壁同学！快停下来！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"f8ce8cb57050cfa27de95f7dd5c78f5ec41ab383d0a4226f87e296712947d71c","ja":"あの、すみません！　面と向かって言うのは\nちょっと照れくさいので……あとで調べてください！","zh":"那个，不好意思！当面说出来\n实在有点不好意思……请您之后自己去查吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3473bc737ba0913be3c4d03e9f732fbebb3035aaee1941d8af4d7790c85c34de","ja":"……だ、そうです。\n私たちの想い、じっくり味わってください。","zh":"……据说，是这样的。\n请细细品味，我们的一片心意。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1537.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9e80bd26ae317686fc90e4a72dcc3e8320bbc67db6a81e2388b9a6d621d0a632","ja":"ふふ、わかったわ。それじゃあ、\nふたりの想いと一緒に、いただくわね♪","zh":"呵呵，我知道了。那么，\n我就连同你们两人的心意一起收下啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
